### 2. Backend API Services & Controllers (`apps/backend/src`)

#### [NEW] [activity-logs.module.ts](file:///d:/ProjectsRecent/Factory-flow-dev/apps/backend/src/activity-logs/activity-logs.module.ts)
- **`ActivityLogsService`**: Helper service to log actions (`logAction(businessId, userId, action, entity, entityId, description, metadata)`).
- **`GET /api/activity-logs`**: Searchable & filterable paginated log list for the current business tenant.

#### [MODIFY] [customers.service.ts](file:///d:/ProjectsRecent/Factory-flow-dev/apps/backend/src/customers/customers.service.ts)
- Soft Delete: `DELETE /api/customers/:id` sets `deletedAt = new Date()` instead of raw delete.
- Update all list/read operations to exclude soft-deleted records (`where: { deletedAt: null }`).
- Emit Activity Logs for `CUSTOMER_CREATE`, `CUSTOMER_UPDATE`, `CUSTOMER_DELETE`.

#### [MODIFY] [products.service.ts](file:///d:/ProjectsRecent/Factory-flow-dev/apps/backend/src/products/products.service.ts)
- Accept optional `price` and `discountedPrice` on create and update.
- Accept optional `initialStock` on product creation to auto-create inventory record.
- Emit Activity Logs for `PRODUCT_CREATE`, `PRODUCT_UPDATE`, `PRODUCT_DELETE`.

#### [MODIFY] [orders.service.ts](file:///d:/ProjectsRecent/Factory-flow-dev/apps/backend/src/orders/orders.service.ts)
- **Order Creation**:
  - Accept `subtotal`, `discountType`, `discountValue`, `discountAmount`, `discountReason`, `additionalCharges`, `grandTotal`, `paymentStatus`, `paymentMethod`.
  - For each `OrderItem`, store `unitPrice`, `priceType` (`STANDARD` | `DISCOUNTED` | `CUSTOM`), and `totalPrice`.
  - Deduct inventory or check stock as required.
- **Status Updates & Cancellation**:
  - Remove `IN_PRODUCTION` status. Support `PENDING`, `DELIVERED`, `CANCELLED`.
  - When status changes to `CANCELLED`:
    - Restore stock in `Inventory`.
    - Create a `StockHistory` entry with reason `"Restored due to Order Cancellation (ORD-xxx)"`.
- **Payment Status Update**:
  - Add endpoint `PATCH /api/orders/:id/payment-status` (`PENDING` -> `COMPLETED`).
- Emit Activity Logs for `ORDER_CREATE`, `ORDER_STATUS_UPDATE`, `ORDER_PAYMENT_UPDATE`.

